<h2>Reset your password</h2>

<p>Hello <%= @user.email %>,</p>

<p>Someone requested a password reset for your <%= @store.name %> account.</p>

<p><a href="<%= @reset_url %>">Click here to reset your password</a></p>

<p>If you didn't request this, please ignore this email. The link expires in 15 minutes.</p>

<p>Or copy this link into your browser:<br>
<%= @reset_url %></p>